GEIST_METAL_PROFILE_SHAPES (added in 3c40d14f for #196, removed in the
cleanup/metal branch, 2026-10-25): with GEIST_METAL_PROFILE=1 and
GEIST_METAL_PIPELINE=1 it printed, at backend destroy, the GPU time per
command buffer keyed by the first dispatch's stage, prefill/decode flag and
threadgroup grid ("shape <stage> <prefill|decode> grid W x H x D ...").
Nothing set it outside ad-hoc #196 measurements. Restore with
  git apply benchmark/results/raw/metal-profile-shapes-2026-10-25/profile_shapes.patch

